<title>USA: Capstead Mortgage Q3 shr $0.60 vs $0.33.</title>
<headline>Capstead Mortgage Q3 shr $0.60 vs $0.33.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.60		    $0.33</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.53		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			 32,428		   21,297</p>
<p>Total Mortgage</p>
<p>   Servicing Revs	33,836		   23,055</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.67		    $0.72</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.50		    $0.72</p>
<p> Net			 91,429		   54,401</p>
<p>Total Mortgage</p>
<p>   Servicing Revs	92,353		   61,083</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: The company earned $13,310,000 from mortgage servicing in the third quarter compared to $9,729,000 during the same quarter in 1995.</p>
<p>Note: Prior period per share information has been adjusted for the previously announced 3-for-2 common stock splts, effective on Oct 30, 1995 and July 31, 1996.</p>
<p>New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
